  "description": [
    "Every state of the Editor's macro pane on one 27 package: a macro's own if (a clause; a grouped and/or), instances before and after a node and on loop body nodes with item gates (a snippet-folder loop; an array-input loop with a case), prepend and append on a deliverable with gates, inline reads through a prompt, a snippet and another macro's instruction, a .content read, a macro folder, an optional macro with a default, and the never-fires, unread and empty-prompt notes. Not clinical."
